    "body": "We don't have a clear idea of what percentage of users disable telemetry. When a user elects to disable it, we should transmit a \"goodbye\" ping, and conversely a \"hello\" ping when a user enables the function.\r\n\r\nThis will help gauge user sentiment around collecting data to improve the browser.",
